Package: holochain-music
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Holochain Music maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-cryptography (>= 41), alsa-utils
Recommends: xdg-utils
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: Artist-first decentralised music player (release candidate)
 Discover music published on a Holochain network, request free artist-issued
 licences, stream encrypted audio over certificate-pinned MoQ/QUIC, and play
 licensed downloads offline. Includes artist publishing and self-hosting.
 This release candidate bundles Holochain 0.7.0 binaries built for Ubuntu 26.04.
